      "title": "infiniband: let dissect_rroce() restore the original pinfo->ptype",
      "message": "infiniband: let dissect_rroce() restore the original pinfo->ptype\n\nSo we set pinfo->ptype = PT_IBQP; only temporary.\n\nHere we also need to restore pinfo->{srcport,destport} as\nthey are set to 0xffffffff.\n\nThis fixes \"Follow UDP stream\" for RoCEv2 connections.\n\nSigned-off-by: Stefan Metzmacher <metze@samba.org>\n",
      "author_name": "Stefan Metzmacher",
      "author_email": "metze@samba.org",
      "authored_date": "2025-08-31T11:04:55.000+02:00",
      "committer_name": "AndersBroman",
